{"comment_text": {"ja30:0.1": "", "ja30:0.2": "", "ja30:0.3": "", "ja30:0.4": "", "ja30:1.1": "A hard-working ox is jealous of the rice scoffed by the pig Munika, but his brother tells him not to worry, as the pig is being fattened for the feast. ", "ja30:1.2": "", "ja30:1.3": "", "ja30:1.4": "", "ja30:2.1": "", "ja30:2.2": "", "ja30:3.1": "", "ja30:4.1": "", "ja30:4.2": "", "ja30:4.3": "", "ja30:4.4": ""}, "html_text": {"ja30:0.1": "<article id='ja30'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja30:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja30:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja30:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja30:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja30:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja30:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja30:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja30:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja30:2.2": "<p class='endvagga'>{}</p>", "ja30:3.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja30:4.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja30:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja30:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja30:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja30:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja30:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja30:0.3": "Kuruṅgavagga ", "ja30:0.4": "10. Munikajātaka ", "ja30:1.1": "“Mā munikassa pihayi, ", "ja30:1.2": "āturannāni bhuñjati; ", "ja30:1.3": "Appossukko bhusaṁ khāda, ", "ja30:1.4": "etaṁ dīghāyulakkhaṇan”ti. ", "ja30:2.1": "Munikajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. ", "ja30:2.2": "Kuruṅgavaggo tatiyo. ", "ja30:3.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja30:4.1": "Kuruṅgassa kukkuragojavaro, ", "ja30:4.2": "Puna vāḷavassasirivhayano; ", "ja30:4.3": "Mahiḷāmukhanāmanuññavaro, ", "ja30:4.4": "Vahate dhura munikena dasāti. "}, "translation_text": {"ja30:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 30 ", "ja30:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja30:0.3": "The Four-horned Antelope ", "ja30:0.4": "The Pig Named Munika: a past life story ", "ja30:1.1": "Envy not what is Munika’s, ", "ja30:1.2": "for he eats the food of the terminally ill. ", "ja30:1.3": "Don’t worry, just eat your chaff, ", "ja30:1.4": "this is a mark of long life. ", "ja30:2.1": "", "ja30:2.2": "", "ja30:3.1": "", "ja30:4.1": "", "ja30:4.2": "", "ja30:4.3": "", "ja30:4.4": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja30:0.1": "", "ja30:0.2": "", "ja30:0.3": "", "ja30:0.4": "", "ja30:1.1": "", "ja30:1.2": "", "ja30:1.3": "", "ja30:1.4": "", "ja30:2.1": "Munikajātakaṁ → muṇikajātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja30:2.2": "", "ja30:3.1": "", "ja30:4.1": "", "ja30:4.2": "vāḷavassasirivhayano → … sirivayano (sabbattha) ", "ja30:4.3": "", "ja30:4.4": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja30:0.1": "", "ja30:0.2": "", "ja30:0.3": "", "ja30:0.4": "", "ja30:1.1": "csp1ed22.8, csp2ed22.8, ms22J_64, msdiv30, pts-vp-pli1.197", "ja30:1.2": "", "ja30:1.3": "", "ja30:1.4": "", "ja30:2.1": "ms22J_65", "ja30:2.2": "", "ja30:3.1": "ms22J_66", "ja30:4.1": "ms22J_67, vri68.8", "ja30:4.2": "", "ja30:4.3": "", "ja30:4.4": ""}, "keys_order": ["ja30:0.1", "ja30:0.2", "ja30:0.3", "ja30:0.4", "ja30:1.1", "ja30:1.2", "ja30:1.3", "ja30:1.4", "ja30:2.1", "ja30:2.2", "ja30:3.1", "ja30:4.1", "ja30:4.2", "ja30:4.3", "ja30:4.4"]}